# ScholarPath — Phase 2 Rules

## Scope Guard

Phase 2 — Intelligence Layer. Build:
- Rule-based filtering engine (field, year, GPA)
- AI ranking via Claude API (with rule-based fallback)
- Per-user recommendation system
- Profile summarization for AI prompts

Do NOT implement yet:
- Motivation letter generation (Phase 3)
- Email or in-app notifications (Phase 4)
- Community, scraping, career module (Phase 5)

## AI Constraints

- AI is stateless — no direct DB writes from Claude
- Backend stores recommendations after AI/ranking pipeline
- System must work without `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` (rule-based fallback)

## New Modules

- `MatchingModule` — rule filter + recommendation orchestration
- `AiModule` — Claude ranking + profile summarization

## Exit Criteria

- Each user sees personalized scholarship rankings
- AI improves relevance over basic filtering when API key is set
